===Other===

====Increases====
*[[Soul Eater]]: 1% increased character size per stack
*[[Divinity]] ({{il|Garb of the Ephemeral}}): {{c|mod|20% increased Character Size}}
*[[Shrine|Massive Shrine]]: {{c|mod|30% increased Character Size}}
*[[Tempest|Enlarging Tempest]]: {{c|mod|30% increased Character Size}}
*{{il|Mon'tregul's Grasp}} ({{c|mod|25% increased [[Raise Zombie]] size}})

====Reductions====
*[[Tempest|Shrinking Tempest]]: {{c|mod|30% reduced Character Size}}
*[[Jewel]]s with the {{c|mod|1% reduced Character Size}} [[legacy]] [[Vaal Orb|corrupted implicit]]

